<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Momentum year share surges, div up.</title>
<headline>Momentum year share surges, div up.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr ended June 30 1996</p>
<p>		(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, headline (cts)   103.4    vs   72.8</p>
<p>    Div (cts) 38.5 making  57.0    vs   40.5</p>
<p>    Net taxed surplus     139.3    vs   98.1</p>
<p>Div payable: October 31</p>
<p>On register: October 18</p>
<p>Full name: Momentum Life Assurers Ltd (insurance)</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said strategic changes which had been made over the last few years would continue to have a positive impact on the group's results over the medium term.</p>
<p>Analysts polled by Reuters had predicted earnings per share of 92.3 cents, with the range 91-95, and a dividend of 50.7, with a range 50.0-52.0.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
